    "description": "Make this simple recipe that will bring sweet pumpkin flavor to your next holiday gathering. In this video, Chef John teaches you how to make old fashioned pumpkin butter. He combines two cans of pumpkin puree with ingredients such as maple syrup, cinnamon, nutmeg, and apple juice for the butter mixture. Cook the mixture over the stove until it reaches the desired thickness before letting it cool in the fridge overnight. This thanksgiving treat has deep and intense flavor with just the right amount of sweetness and is best enjoyed with a slice of toast!",
